":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T08:20:53-07:00","id":921497,"title":"","content":"I have an answer for this one, but it was part of one of my sections in C20. I don't think Matt would like me to share that just yet <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T14:52:58-07:00","id":921701,"title":"","content":"So what are you doing? Just teasing me?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T16:30:14-07:00","id":921743,"title":"","content":"Trying to have a little fun and share my excitement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T18:35:12-07:00","id":921797,"title":"","content":"It's been a long time since I played a Changeling who changed court (with Cyclical Court Change), but one thing that helped me was picking complimentary Legacies. Both his Seelie and Unseelie aspects were basically riffing on the same general theme, in this case Sage and Humbug. He was an experienced Grump who had seen a lot, with the main difference being whether that made him worldly or world-weary, as well as how much patience he had with the younger Changelings in the court.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T18:57:41-07:00","id":921809,"title":"","content":"yes its an easy thing to do, My Ailil childling had Ringleader/Dandy, yet legacys that DONT compliment each other that well can be worth exploring in their interplay<br /> <br /> Like Ring Leader and Squire.<br /> <br /> Ring leader WANTS to be in the lime light, squire doesnt<br /> <br /> Not sure how to play that other then going crazy.<br /> <br /> or Regent and Wretch<br /> <br /> Really no idea how to play that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 06-26-2016, 10:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T20:18:38-07:00","id":921829,"title":"","content":"Ring Leader and Squire aren't so strange a combination really. Being the center of attention has a lot of pros and cons, which people can desire for different reasons and may desire to wildly varying degrees depending on the circumstance and their own disposition. Even a Squire wants to be recognized now and again, and even a Ringleader needs their moments of privacy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T12:51:28-07:00","id":922178,"title":"","content":"ideas on Regent and Wretch? <br /> <br /> I know that it may not seem to matter since their suppressed legacy is, well suppressed, but it still influences their personality.<br /> <br /> A regent/Wretch, might be a leader who underneath it all fears he can never be good enough, or a miserable figure with a deeply hidden backbone, wanting to assume a position of authority.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T13:11:01-07:00","id":922184,"title":"","content":"Sure, any of those work. You can make any combination of Legacies function if you just take the time to think it through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}